Build an immersive space exploration section with a navigable Solar System. Users should select planets, dwarf planets, moons, asteroids, comets and other celestial objects to learn about them.

Create attractive animated 3D-style celestial models where supported, with selectable camera views and optional labels.

For each planet, include its size, mass, distance from the Sun, orbital period, rotation period, gravity, atmosphere, temperature range where well-supported, moons, surface characteristics and exploration history. Clearly distinguish scientific measurements from simplified illustrations.

Include:
